==Trivia==
[[File:TCGP Cover Tree of Repose.png|thumb|"Tree of Repose" binder cover]]
This card's standard illustration is part of a {{TCG|combined illustration}} along with {{TCG ID|Mythical Island|Chewtle|22}}, {{TCG ID|Mythical Island|Primeape|42}}, and {{TCG ID|Mythical Island|Pidgeotto|58}} from the same expansion. Together, these cards form the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion's "Tree of Repose" [[Mythical Island (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], the completion reward for which is the "Tree of Repose" binder cover, showcasing the full illustration.

===Origin===
*{{m|Thunder Shock}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Dedenne}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

